Scope. This MIT licence covers the code and documentation in this repository:
check.py, the other scripts, the tests, web/, SCHEMA.md, README.md, gaps.md and
the generated reports.

The register itself — every record under entities/ and every obstacle under
Engpass/obstacles/, including the ratings, witnesses and blockers they carry —
is data, and is licensed separately under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0). See entities/LICENSE. Disease identifiers in
those records are borrowed from the Mondo Disease Ontology, itself CC BY 4.0.
